        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Stephen Curry, Anthony Davis, James Harden\n- Organizations: NBA, Golden State Warriors, New Orleans Pelicans, Houston Rockets\n- Products: NBA 2K16\n- Concepts: MVP, 50–40–90 club\n\nFacts:\n- Stephen Curry became the first player in NBA history to be elected MVP by a unanimous vote.\n- Stephen Curry also led the NBA in scoring while shooting above 50–40–90 in the same season.\n- The 50–40–90 club had only seven players who had recorded 50–40–90 seasons.\n- NBA 2K16 had three different main covers featuring Anthony Davis of the New Orleans Pelicans, Stephen Curry of the Golden State Warriors, and James Harden of the Houston Rockets.",
